t-weight:700;\">Mark Processing</div><div style=\"font-size:11px;color:#9aa8b8;\">DB Status: Processing</div></div><div style=\"color:#8fa1b5;font-size:24px;\">&darr;</div><div style=\"width:180px;padding:12px;background:#2d1a3f;border:1px solid #7b4f9c;border-radius:8px;text-align:center;\"><div style=\"font-weight:700;color:#e1c3f5;\">Gateway Charge</div><div style=\"font-size:11px;color:#9aa8b8;\"><span style=\"color:#5d7085;\">payment.gateway.charge</span></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:32px;margin-top:8px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"color:#8ee6b8;font-size:12px;\">[Success]</div><div style=\"color:#8fa1b5;font-size:24px;\">&darr;</div><div style=\"width:160px;padding:12px;background:#13271f;border:1px solid #2f8f5b;border-radius:8px;text-align:center;\"><div style=\"font-weight:700;color:#8ee6b8;\">Succeeded</div><div style=\"font-size:11px;color:#9aa8b8;\">DB Status: Succeeded</div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"color:#f0a1aa;font-size:12px;\">[Failure]</div><div style=\"color:#8fa1b5;font-size:24px;\">&darr;</div><div style=\"width:160px;padding:12px;background:#2b1719;border:1px solid #b64a55;border-radius:8px;text-align:center;\"><div style=\"font-weight:700;color:#f0a1aa;\">Failed</div><div style=\"font-size:11px;color:#9aa8b8;\">DB Status: Failed</div></div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;width:180px;margin-top:-4px;margin-bottom:-4px;\"><div style=\"color:#8fa1b5;font-size:24px;\">&searr;</div><div style=\"color:#8fa1b5;font-size:24px;\">&swarr;</div></div><div style=\"width:220px;padding:12px;background:#17212b;border:1px solid #34465a;border-radius:8px;text-align:center;\"><div style=\"font-weight:700;\">Publish Result Event</div><div style=\"font-size:11px;color:#9aa8b8;\">Succeeded / Failed Event<br><span style=\"color:#5d7085;\">payment.publish_result_event</span></div></div><div style=\"color:#8fa1b5;font-size:24px;\">&darr;</div><div style=\"width:180px;padding:12px;background:#1f2937;border:2px solid #6366f1;border-radius:24px;text-align:center;\"><div style=\"font-weight:700;color:#fff;\">Ordering API</div><div style=\"font-size:11px;color:#9aa8b8;\">Consumes Event</div></div><div style=\"color:#8fa1b5;font-size:24px;\">&darr;</div><div style=\"width:180px;padding:12px;background:#17212b;border:1px solid #34465a;border-radius:8px;text-align:center;\"><div style=\"font-weight:700;\">Order Paid / Cancelled</div><div style=\"font-size:11px;color:#9aa8b8;\">Ordering DB Status Updated</div></div><div style=\"color:#8fa1b5;font-size:24px;\">&darr;</div><div style=\"width:180px;padding:12px;background:#13271f;border:2px solid #2f8f5b;border-radius:24px;text-align:center;\"><div style=\"font-weight:700;color:#8ee6b8;\">Order Status Updated</div></div></div></div>"
